SUSE's cves.patch of nodejs18 18.20.8 of SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP4 LTSS,
https://api.opensuse.org/public/source/SUSE:SLE-15-SP4:Update/nodejs18.46615/cves.patch
(Adam Majer <adam.majer@suse.de>, 15.09.2026; its nodejs18.changes lists the CVEs),
as it is, without the sections of deps/cares, deps/nghttp2 and deps/llhttp (the
libraries of az and of www/llhttp, the same releases or newer, take their place),
of tools/dep_updaters (scripts of the maintainers) and the two binary ones (the
wasm builds of llhttp in deps/undici/src, which patch cannot apply and the build
does not use: deps/undici/undici.js carries them): azsupport/ports, 11.11.2026.

